#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Failing-first proof of the gateway: one hand mutation per rule, each must
make its named test fail. Run from gateway/: python3 -I mutate.py

A mutant that does not build, or that go vet refuses, proves nothing: it is
BUILD, never KILLED, and the run fails. A test name that matches no test is
NOTEST, and the run fails too. Each test of a mutant has 2 minutes:
a mutant that hangs is KILLED at the timeout."""
